1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,860
[Umayuru: Full Gate]

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:05,230
Hmmm...

3
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:08,920
[Mejiro Dober] [Mejiro McQueen]
What gift could possibly be good enough for Grandmother?

4
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:12,099
Maybe the pearl necklace?

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,139
[Aines Fujin] [Ikuno Dictus]
That might be a little predictable.

6
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,559
Yeah...

7
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:16,900
Oh, what about this?!

8
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,289
[Mejiro Ryan]
High-quality protein!

9
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:22,000
You trying to turn her into a bodybuilder?!

10
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:27,850
[Mejiro Bright]
I'm here! Who's ready to start thinking of a present?

11
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:30,439
We're just about ready to give up...

12
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,999
Oh dear...

13
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,939
Ikuno, Ines.

14
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:36,510
Isn't there any more advice you could give us?

15
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:41,749
What's the most memorable gift you've ever given her?

16
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:42,859
Oh!

17
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:45,859
Remember the letter we wrote when we were little?

18
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:49,390
Ah, the one McQueen read aloud for us.

19
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,230
Sounds nice!

20
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:57,479
I love the letter my little sisters gave me—still read it all the time!

21
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:58,729
In that case...

22
00:00:58,730 --> 00:01:02,729
Maybe you could recreate that experience by writing another letter.

23
00:01:02,730 --> 00:01:05,399
Like, we could say how much we've grown?

24
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:08,369
Perfect! That'd be so touching!

25
00:01:08,370 --> 00:01:09,980
I, um...

26
00:01:10,710 --> 00:01:13,099
I have an idea.

27
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:16,100
What if, this time, it was more than just a letter...

28
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:23,120
[The big day]

29
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:30,380
Happy birthday, Grandmother.

30
00:01:30,780 --> 00:01:34,690
Today, we would like to express how grateful we are to you.

31
00:01:36,860 --> 00:01:41,229
You have watched over us for all these years

32
00:01:41,230 --> 00:01:44,559
with both strict eyes and a kind heart.

33
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:47,479
You filled our days with running and laughter

34
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:55,229
And it's those precious memories with you that have
made us who we are today—proud Mejiros.

35
00:01:55,230 --> 00:02:01,229
In difficult times, you took us by the hand and told us to stand tall.

36
00:02:01,230 --> 00:02:04,339
And we were always able to persevere.

37
00:02:04,340 --> 00:02:12,779
We may have a long way to go, but we will face
ever forward and never stray from our goals.

38
00:02:12,780 --> 00:02:17,480
So that the light of the Mejiro name may shine forever.

39
00:02:34,091 --> 00:02:37,749
Olé! Olé! Samba! Legs going crazy, hands up!

40
00:02:37,750 --> 00:02:39,679
Give in and let the dance flow!

41
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,639
Yaaaay!

42
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:45,770
Olé! Olé! Keep up!
Don't stop, we've got a lot more song to go!

43
00:02:45,768 --> 00:02:47,179
(Here we go, samba!)

44
00:02:47,180 --> 00:02:49,589
Samba! Every day a samba!

45
00:02:49,590 --> 00:02:52,769
Uma, Uma! Samba! Samba! Samba!

46
00:02:52,770 --> 00:02:53,531
(Uma samba?!)

47
00:02:53,530 --> 00:02:55,659
Samba! Let's go faster! Samba!

48
00:02:55,660 --> 00:02:59,462
Come on, come on! Samba!
Samba! Samba! Samba!

49
00:02:59,460 --> 00:03:01,851
Yuru yuru samba!

